00:03:33.932 --> 00:03:36.372
At this point, we don't know whether they'll be friend or foe.

00:03:36.452 --> 00:03:36.872
Lieutenant?

00:03:37.612 --> 00:03:40.412
Lieutenant, do you actually believe this is a good idea?

00:03:42.124 --> 00:03:43.944
I believe it's worth making the attempt.

00:03:44.204 --> 00:03:45.184
